        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4412' id='14' type-v2='text' w='48720' x='3120' y='89706'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#8fa6bc'>Base: all 7,043 customers. Full recommendations and caveats are in the written churn memo</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11765' id='15' type-v2='text' w='86400' x='3200' y='23529'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4cc2a5' fontsize='16'>1.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f2f6fa' fontsize='16'> No blanket fiber discounts</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#8fa6bc' fontsize='11'>At the same price, fiber churns far more than DSL, and fiber churn falls as the bill rises.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#8fa6bc' fontsize='11'>Owner: Head of Marketing · Decide by 7ᵗʰ October, 2026</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11765' id='16' type-v2='text' w='86400' x='3200' y='38235'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4cc2a5' fontsize='16'>2.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#f2f6fa' fontsize='16'> Pull the competitor detail behind fiber cancellations</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#8fa6bc' fontsize='11'>Reason codes say churners left for a competitor. They don&apos;t say which one, or what device or offer won them.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#8fa6bc' fontsize='11'>Owner: Head of Strategic Research · Decide by 1ˢᵗ October, 2026</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
